# GDScript conventions

## Naming

- Signals: `ev_*`
- Files: `snake_case.gd`; scene colocated
- Types: `PascalCase` + `class_name` when shared
- FSM state IDs: `static func get_state() -> String`

## Patterns

- Wire with `@export` (editor-first)
- Dynamic lists: instantiate template `.tscn`
- Pure logic → `RefCounted`; Nodes stay thin
- Signal subscriptions → `EventListener`; tear down in `deinit`
- Apply config copies with `ResourceUtils.update_resource()`

## Must

- Prefix cross-object signals with `ev_`
- Support touch + mouse
- Every `.tscn` F6-runs isolated with exported defaults

## Avoid

- Autoloads for game flow (use `RootEvents` / `GameEvents` Resources)
- Feature A importing Feature B internals
- Building full menus with `Control.new()` trees
- Putting project types into `core/`
